==Battleground==
*5 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 5 seconds<sup>150f</sup>, delay 3.33~6.67 seconds<sup>100f~200f</sup>.
*5 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
*3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 3.33~10 seconds<sup>100f~300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Ken (Enemy)|Ken]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 10~20 seconds<sup>300f~600f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**3 [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**3 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
**Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
**3 [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Ken may look scary at first, but he has a major weakness: his Red typing. Stack crowd-controllers at the start including [[Pirate Cat (Rare Cat)|Dread Pirate Catley]] or [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Apple Cat]] as well as some attackers (preferably ones that outrange his 330 range Omni Strike for consistent damage, such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Cyborg Cat]]) and you have won. Bring [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] for a faster victory either way.

